# Your signing team and bundle id, read by Latchkey.xcconfig so Xcode's Run
# and `make device` agree (docs/SETUP.md §3). The project itself carries no
# team and defaults the bundle id to the author's.
/Local.xcconfig
# The older home of the Team ID for `make device` alone; still read as a
# fallback when Local.xcconfig has no DEVELOPMENT_TEAM.
/.dev-team
